			"notes": "- **Full rewrite to Mojang mappings**\n- **Persistent loaders:** Loader state is now saved and survives restarts.  \n- **Managed chunk loading:** Chunks stay loaded only while a valid loader is active; they unload automatically when the loader becomes inactive or invalid.  \n- **Tiered chunk coverage:** Netherite 5×5 (reduced from 7×7 for performance).  \n- **No overlapping loaders:** Multiple loaders cannot force the same chunks.  \n- **Visual and HUD improvements:** Particle effects and in-game HUD show loader status and radius.  \n- **v1.0 migration:** Old loader state is not imported; ghost-loaded chunks from v1.0 must be cleared manually.\n- **Minor fixes and tweaksnd tweaks**"
